

### 🧑‍💼 Job Seeker Features:
- **Login via OTP (email or mobile)** using Firebase Authentication or a secure alternative.
- **Search and filter jobs** based on:
  - Location
  - Profile/Job Title
  - Employment type (Full-time, Part-time, Freelance)
- **Apply to jobs** by submitting a resume and short profile.
- **View application status**, and interview updates.
- **Personal dashboard** with applied jobs, interview schedules, and resume editing.

---

### 🧑‍💻 Recruiter Features:
- **Recruiter Login** via OTP or email/password.
- **Post job requirements** including title, location, description, qualifications, salary, and experience.
- **Dashboard to view applicants** per job post.
- **View applicant details** (resume, contact, etc.).
- **Lineup interviews** by setting up a schedule and notifying job seekers via email/portal notifications.
- **Manage job posts** (edit, close, delete).

---

### 🔐 Authentication:
- OTP-based login system.
- Secure session management and role-based access control.

